{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/N83sMZHIPCFBYpoHWI6VtQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:31.015578+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/N83sMZHIPCFBYpoHWI6VtQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/Ls4X2XFBgIRJQwbMgvIz7FWvmEllkQdkiaicbPPg0YnAeHH7NGicvHKB60z2UCnB1xP9EkCtHdOILHNkLHjtBWKiaQ/640?from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025</span></strong></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>经济与管理学院金融硕士（专业学位）</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>“优秀大学生夏令营</span><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>活动</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>ECNU</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学文脉绵长、声誉卓著，是教育部直属并与上海市重点共建的综合性研究型大学。2006年学校进入国家“985工程”高校行列。2017年学校进入国家“世界一流大学”建设高校A类行列，全面开启扎根中国大地建设一流大学的新征程。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学经济与管理学院具有悠久的办学历史。学科门类齐全、培养体系完整，拥有应用经济学、工商管理学、信息资源管理三个一级学科博士点，设有应用经济学博士后科研流动站和工商管理学博士后科研流动站，在MBA、金融、会计、国际商务、旅游管理、图书情报等项目上招收专业型硕士。学院师资力量雄厚，拥有一支潜心教学、爱岗敬业的教师队伍，既有德高望重的资深教授，又有在学术界崭露头角的青年才俊。学院作为中国商科教育和科研的中坚力量，肩负着卓越人才培养、卓越学术研究、卓越社会服务的光荣使命，致力于建成中国特色、世界一流的经济和管理学科重镇。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学经济与管理学院金融硕士（专业学位）</span></span><strong><span><span>“2025年优秀大学生夏令营”将于</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>2025年7月2日至7月4日（7月1日下午报到）在华东师范大学普陀校区举行，计划营员人数60名，实际入营人数将根据报名情况适当调整。</span></span></strong><span><span>旨在促进华东师范大学金融学科与各兄弟院校相关学科的了解与交流，提高学生对金融学科的兴趣，吸引更多优秀本科生深入金融领域，为金融学科发展持续注入活力。欢迎全国有意申请我院金融硕士（专业学位）推荐免试研究生的同学积极报名参加。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、学科介绍</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img alt=\"15596959FFCBE0720FA54F2BD47_05C14B77_3DA5A.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icR3MU4gtwXiaVbyMwGLwxwtBkr79vbq4cC0RHCal2Qvflibju5aAQCiawKdyNsCsyDibTrzX4wnzTQStFJynpxYOibQ/640\" title=\"15596959FFCBE0720FA54F2BD47_05C14B77_3DA5A.jpg\"/></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学经济与管理学院金融学科具有悠久的历史、突出的特色。</span></span><span><span>著名经济学家陈彪如先生开创了中</span></span><span><span>国</span></span><span><span>国际金融学</span></span><span><span>，是全国率先开展国际金融学人才培养的高校，获得首批全国金融学博士授权点。拥有金融学本科、金融学硕士及金融学博士等完备的金融学人才培养体系，为国家及上海输送了大批高级金融人才。</span></span><span><span>立足于新时代</span></span><span><span>金融强国建设</span></span><span><span>对</span></span><span><span>卓越</span></span><span><span>金融人才培养的新要求，</span></span><span><span>我院金融学科不断开拓以人工智能金融为代表的新学科增长点，形成了以中国金融为底色、国际金融为特色、人工智能金融为引擎的学科方向及人才培养框架，致力于为金融强国和上海国际金融中心建设输送金融英才。</span></span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>华东师范大学金融硕士（专业学位）</span></span><span><span>是</span></span><span><span>2011</span><span><span>年全国第一批招收金融硕士（专业学位）</span></span></span><span><span>的学位点。本学位点秉持“唯卓越方可立足</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的育人理念</span></span><span><span>，定位于</span></span><span><span>培养具备良好</span></span><span><span>思想</span></span><span><span>政治素养</span></span><span><span>和国际视野、</span></span><span><span>充分了解金融理论与实务，系统掌握投融资管理方法、金融交易技术与操作、金融产品设计与定价、财务分析以及金融科技和</span></span><span><span>人工智能</span></span><span><span>金融相关领域的知识技能，具有解决金融实际问题能力的应用型卓越金融人才。</span></span><span><span>依托雄厚的师资队伍、一批高水平研究机构（如</span></span><span><span>陈彪如先生一手创办的国际金融研究所、</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>与上海市人民政府发展研究中心共建的中国金融研究院</span></span><span><span>等）以及与众多知名金融机构合作建立的实践育人基地打造复合型金融人才。</span></span><span><span>让</span></span><span><span>广大莘莘学子</span></span><span><span>在更广阔的舞台上眺望世界、施展才华、成就自我</span></span><span><span>！</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、招生专业</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>金融专硕（全日制，学制两年）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、报名条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><span><span>金融硕士（专业学位）优秀大学生夏令营，主要面向全国高等院校（含本校）有志攻读硕士研究生的优秀2022级（拟2026年夏毕业）在校本科生。报名条件如下：</span></span></section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.立志成为高层次实践创新型人才；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学习成绩优异，能够获得所在学校推免面试资格者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.具有较强的英语听说和写作能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.专业为金融学类、经济学类、经济与贸易类、会计学、统计学类、数学类、计算机类以及软件工程、人工智能、数据科学等相关专业，有志于投身金融业。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img alt=\"微信图片_20241219212420.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icR3MU4gtwXg26kuILRraib1nxAfcc4ppdYY3AMUiaDic7Q83ra2aY5c79k0yfGoMhx9A45O7IDljajO6xJrsIOJnQ/640?from=appmsg\" title=\"微信图片_20241219212420.jpg\"/></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>四、活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span><span>本次夏令营将于2025年7月2日至7月4日（7月1日下午报到）在华东师范大学普陀校区举行。拟开展的活动包括前沿讲座、知名专家互动交流、企业调研、优秀营员评选等。具体开营时间、入营安排等内容，后续在入营邮件中发布。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>五、报名程序及提交资料</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span><span><span>025年6月5日12:00起至6月17日24:00，请通过“华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4</span></span><span>）全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行网上报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>1、报名流程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（1）注册。进入报名页面后，请先注册，注册时务必填写真实有效信息。每位申请人最多可注册2个报名号、填报2个申请志愿。如已填报2个志愿且其中某个志愿未通过审核，则仅可在当前院系内修改专业或研究方向，不可改报院系。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）填写报名信息。根据系统提示，逐一填写报名信息，填写完毕并确认无误后，点击“确认并提交”，报名完成。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）在院系报名截止时间前，可随时修改报名信息，报名截止后不可更改。申请完成后，可以查看申请状态与结果。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2、上传材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（1）居民身份证。请上传本人有效期内的居民身份证正反面，PDF格式。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）夏令营诚信承诺书。请点击：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>https://yjszs.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/a8/03/9a70150f414ea745872623f9bb65/0ba43566-aeec-49e4-9b41-5783a4606572.pd</span><span>f</span></span><span><span> 保存下载、打印、本人签名后扫描PDF格式上传。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表（报名系统自动生成）。请下载、打印、本人签名后扫描PDF格式上传。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）其他证明材料，合成一个PDF，首页列出所含材料目录，包括：加盖校教务部门公章本科成绩单（前五学期）；前五学期成绩排名及班级/专业总人数，加盖申请人所在学校教务部门或院系公章后扫描；个人陈述，介绍本人的学习成绩、专业能力、外语能力、学术研究兴趣、曾参与过的科研项目、创新意识创新能力、研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、其它特长及本人认为对于申请有参考价值的内容，签字后扫描；其他补充材料（非必须），如英语等级证书、论文发表、各类获奖或资格证书等扫描件。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>六、营员遴选与评价</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>我院将根据申请人情况进行审查、筛选，择优入营。拟在2025年6月25日前在系统中公布入选营员的名单，报名者届时可登录报名系统查询是否入选。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营拟评选优秀营员。优秀营员的评选规则、效力认定等另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>七、营员支持资助</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>我院将为营员提供夏令营期间的校内餐券（7月1日晚-7月4日晚），提供外地学生从学校或家庭所在地至上海往返火车费用（硬座/硬卧、高铁/动车二等座），不包括飞机票，报到时提交往返来沪火车票（报销凭证），请提前打印好往返车票，凭票报销。住宿自理。</span></span><span></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>八、其他事项</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>1、营员入选后须全程参与夏令营各项活动，不得缺席。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2、诚信参营，因材料弄虚作假或行为违规、作弊等而谋利的，一旦查实将取消获取的资格、结果自负。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3、联系方式：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：021-62231353</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系邮箱：wyzhu@admin.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>咨询时间：9:00-11:30，13:30-17:00(</span></span><span><span><span>周一至周五)</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院网站：https://sem.ecnu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span>编辑丨肖启玉</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核丨吴文钰</span></span></section><section></se